  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">David Jimenez's second photobook represents an evolution of the author's photographic language that began with Infinito, already a milestone in the recent history of the Spanish photobook. In a sense, versus maintains the same interest in compositional structures based on symmetry, while at the same time probing more complex poetic resonances and images, at the very limits of representation. - publishers description.</subfield>
